# UE is configured with 3T + 2F CA, maxPayloadSize of PUCCH resource set[1] is set to 24; maxCodeRate of PUCCH format3 shall be set to a value >= 0.25, maxCodeRate: zeroDot25 (2). 
# PUCCH resource set[2] detail id refer to below:
# Resource F3_Id =9 which used for CSI-REPORT of Pcell Channel state feedback
# Resource F3_Id =18 which use for CSI-REPORT of Pcell beam report(if beamforming enabled)
# Resource F3_Id =19 which use for CSI-REPORT of SCell1 Channel state feedback
# Resource F3_Id =20 which use for CSI-REPORT of Scell1 beam report(if beamforming enabled)
